        "description": "نِحنَ (niHna) - \"We\": This pronoun represents the first-person plural subject. It includes the speaker and one or more other people. For example, \".نِحنَ بِنَدرُس في الجامعَه\" (niHna binadrus fi j-jaam3a) means \"We study at the university.\"",
