        "description": "إنتوا (intu) - \"You\" (plural): This pronoun is used to address a group of people in the second-person plural form. It is used when addressing a single or mixed-gender group. For example, \"إنتوا كيف؟\" (intu keef?) means \"How are you all?\".",
        "_id": "7",
