        "description": "هُم (hum) - \"They\": This pronoun refers to the third-person plural subject, both for single and mixed-gender groups. For example, \"هُم شَغّالين في الشَرِكَه.\" (hum shaghghaaliin fi sh-sharika) means \"They work in the company.\"",
